{"page":303,"verses":[{"verse_key":"18:84","surah":18,"ayah":84,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّا مَكَّنَّا لَهُۥ فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ مِن كُلِّ شَىْءٍ سَبَبًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We established his power in the land, and gave him the means to achieve everything.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, We","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"18:84"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَكَّنَّا","en_gloss":"[We] established","transliteration":"makkannā","verse_key":"18:84"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"[for] him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"18:84"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"18:84"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the earth","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"18:84"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"and We gave him","transliteration":"waātaynāhu","verse_key":"18:84"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"18:84"},{"pos":8,"ar":"كُلِّ","en_gloss":"every","transliteration":"kulli","verse_key":"18:84"},{"pos":9,"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","en_gloss":"thing","transliteration":"shayin","verse_key":"18:84"},{"pos":10,"ar":"سَبَبًۭا","en_gloss":"a means","transliteration":"sababan","verse_key":"18:84"},{"pos":11,"ar":"٨٤","en_gloss":"(84)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"18:84"}]},{"verse_key":"18:85","surah":18,"ayah":85,"ar_uthmani":"فَأَتْبَعَ سَبَبًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He travelled on a certain road;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَتْبَعَ","en_gloss":"So he followed","transliteration":"fa-atbaʿa","verse_key":"18:85"},{"pos":2,"ar":"سَبَبًا","en_gloss":"a course","transliteration":"sababan","verse_key":"18:85"},{"pos":3,"ar":"٨٥","en_gloss":"(85)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"18:85"}]},{"verse_key":"18:86","surah":18,"ayah":86,"ar_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا بَلَغَ مَغْرِبَ ٱلشَّمْسِ وَجَدَهَا تَغْرُبُ فِى عَيْنٍ حَمِئَةٍ وَوَجَدَ عِندَهَا قَوْمًا ۗ قُلْنَا يَـٰذَا ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ إِمَّآ أَن تُعَذِّبَ وَإِمَّآ أَن تَتَّخِذَ فِيهِمْ حُسْنًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"then, when he came to the setting of the sun, he found it [seemed to be] setting into a muddy spring. Nearby he found some people and We said, ‘Dhu ’l-Qarnayn, you may choose [which of them] to punish or show kindness to.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"Until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":2,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بَلَغَ","en_gloss":"he reached","transliteration":"balagha","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَغْرِبَ","en_gloss":"(the) setting place","transliteration":"maghriba","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلشَّمْسِ","en_gloss":"(of) the sun","transliteration":"l-shamsi","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَجَدَهَا","en_gloss":"he found it","transliteration":"wajadahā","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَغْرُبُ","en_gloss":"setting","transliteration":"taghrubu","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَيْنٍ","en_gloss":"a spring","transliteration":"ʿaynin","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":10,"ar":"حَمِئَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) dark mud","transliteration":"ḥami-atin","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَوَجَدَ","en_gloss":"and he found","transliteration":"wawajada","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عِندَهَا","en_gloss":"near it","transliteration":"ʿindahā","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قَوْمًۭا ۗ","en_gloss":"a community","transliteration":"qawman","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":14,"ar":"قُلْنَا","en_gloss":"We said","transliteration":"qul'nā","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":15,"ar":"يَـٰذَا","en_gloss":"O Dhul-qarnain","transliteration":"yādhā","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْقَرْنَيْنِ","en_gloss":"O Dhul-qarnain","transliteration":"l-qarnayni","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":17,"ar":"إِمَّآ","en_gloss":"Either","transliteration":"immā","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"18:86"},{"pos":19,"ar":"